OL,3,AWill the Thirlwall report change the
OL,4,Adebate about Lucy Letby?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMention Lucy Letby and you're likely to
OL,7,Fget a strong reaction.
OL,9,FThe nurse was sentenced to spend the
OL,10,Frest of her life in prison for
OL,11,Fmurdering seven babies and attempting
OL,12,Fto murder seven more.
OL,14,FBut though two juries have convicted
OL,15,Fher, and she has twice been denied
OL,16,Fpermission to appeal, it seems everyone
OL,17,Fhas an opinion on whether she really
OL,18,Fdid it.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
